 \section{Administration}
 Participants will complete one practice trial in the first assigned voice, followed by two counterbalanced voice blocks of 40 measured trials each. The final survey will administer two separately labelled retrospective questionnaire sets, one referring to each voice block, with identical item wording and order. The break between blocks will include immediate comfort and tracking checks but no questionnaire, and survey administration and rest breaks will both fall outside active-search timing.
